From 14f008ff931534049d553b35a6d7ee9d1b5cd750 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cheng-Yang Chou <yphbchou0911@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 20:59:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH sched_ext/for-7.4 2/7] selftests/sched_ext: Fix bpf_link leaks
 on early return from run()

Ten tests destroy the link at the end of run(), after checks that can
return early. Convert them to the context helpers so that cleanup()
always destroys it. Also convert select_cpu_dfl, which open-codes the
same context.

select_cpu_dispatch and select_cpu_dfl_nodispatch also reap all their
children before reporting, so a failed check no longer leaves zombies.

Fixes: a5db7817af78 ("sched_ext: Add selftests")
Fixes: 36adf6fe6cbe ("selftests/sched_ext: Update test enq_select_cpu_fails")
Fixes: 5ae5161820e5 ("selftests/sched_ext: Add NUMA-aware scheduler test")
Fixes: c31f2ee5cd7d ("sched_ext: Fix enq_last_no_enq_fails selftest")
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Cheng-Yang Chou <yphbchou0911@gmail.com>
